  (text "AUDIO CARD  -  ESP32-DevKitC-VE (socketed) + 2 x PCM5102A (4 line outputs) + PCM1808 (hands-free microphone input)" (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cde8723d-db38-5175-8f42-4d77df5e9352"))
  (text "Card for a DigiDash slot, 80 x 60 mm, standing on edge (docs/hardware/accessory_ports.md); its place is slot 1 (the RCA block is 26.5 mm tall). CAN node 0x14 + (slot - 1), from the slot ID on GPIO36. 5 V from the slot only; 3.3 V from the DevKitC's regulator." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9b34809a-04d1-5c9d-a723-5d6b8835ffda"))
