  (text "POWER: +5 V from the slot to the DevKitC 5V pin; its own 3.3 V regulator supplies +3V3 (the converters' digital sides, the buffer, CAN VIO: tens of mA). Ferrites make +5VA (PCM1808 analog, mic op-amp) and +3V3A (PCM5102A analog + charge pump). Do not plug the DevKitC USB in while the card is powered from the slot." (at 15 100 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "60a0fe5d-cc56-5454-88d3-aa61811f300d"))
