  (text "I2S0 master: BCK GPIO14, WS GPIO25, DOUT GPIO27 (front DAC), DIN GPIO35 (PCM1808), MCLK GPIO0 (12.288 MHz for the ADC).\nI2S1 slave on the same BCK / WS pins: DOUT GPIO26 (rear DAC). GPIO4 = DAC mute (XSMT), pulled low. GPIO32 / 33 CAN.\nSlot: GPIO36 slot ID (ADC1), GPIO34 I2S1 data in from the I2S rail (LINK3 = RET), GPIO21 low enables the rail buffer.\nProgramming: the DevKitC's USB (its BOOT / EN buttons and auto-reset). GPIO0 is the BOOT strap there too: the PCM1808 SCKI input just sits on it." (at 215 150 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8a7d3003-33a3-50e1-a1c8-ff60b8be0095"))
  (text "CAN: TJA1051T/3 (VDD 5 V, VIO 3.3 V). No 120 R: the card never terminates the bus." (at 15 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "199d87cd-06a7-503c-88e2-0e1f5ef6e81a"))
