  (text "PCM5102A: 3-wire I2S, SCK tied to ground (internal PLL from BCK, BCK must be 64 fS), FMT low = I2S, FLT low, DEMP low.\nXSMT is driven by GPIO4 and pulled low, so the outputs stay muted until the firmware un-mutes them (no boot pop).\nLine outputs are ground-centred 2.1 Vrms: no DC-block caps. 470 R + 2.2n at each output as in the datasheet. Both DACs share BCK / LRCK; each has its own data line (front GPIO27, rear GPIO26)." (at 330 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1ff55b8f-4fdf-51bf-b73a-5bbf0d70c414"))
