  (text "MICROPHONE (hands-free calls only, no line / aux input): 3.5 mm jack J6 for an electret car microphone on a mono TS plug (plug-in power). Tip = mic, bias 2.2k from MICV (+5VA through 1k + 47u). Ring and sleeve to ground, so a TS or a TRS plug works.\nPreamp: TLV9062 A non-inverting, gain 1 + 47k / 2.2k = 22.4 (27 dB): -42 dBV/Pa gives 0.18 Vrms at 94 dB SPL, clipping (PCM1808 full scale 3 Vp-p, about 1 Vrms) at about 109 dB SPL. DC gain 1 at mid-supply (2.5 V). TLV9062 B (spare) is a follower on VMID; the ADC right input is AC-grounded." (at 30 340 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dd605b9d-697b-5beb-a330-e8d86baabbe4"))
  (symbol (lib_id "Device:R") (at 90 365 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "fa9b7e7d-3594-5558-9942-6001a003474f")
