  (text "GPIO0 outputs the 12.288 MHz clock (256 x 48 kHz) after boot. The DevKitC BOOT button and auto-reset still pull it low to enter the ROM loader." (at 430 415 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cb437254-c822-5a25-a266-44b40c364a5a"))
  (text "I2S RAIL (bused to every slot; this card is its clock master): a 74LVC125 drives LINK0 BCK, LINK1 WS, LINK2 the mic data (PCM1808 DOUT) and LINK4 MCLK, only while GPIO21 holds its enables low (pulled high: off at reset). LINK3 (RET: the I2S data of the card granted the rail over CAN) comes in on GPIO34 (I2S1 data in).\nAUDIO BUS: the front pair drives AUDIO_L / R through 100 R; AUDIO_GND joins this card's ground through 10 R." (at 530 300 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b43537b3-c385-55d0-ac59-ef197d5f8b2f"))
